                                                   'Evaluation for Canadian PR & Abroad</h2>\n'
                                                   '          <p>Online degrees from NAAC A+/A++ accredited Indian '
                                                   'universities hold full international currency. World Education '
                                                   'Services (WES)—the official credential evaluation agency for '
