                                                   'copy-paste, second monitors, browser tabs, and background '
                                                   'communication software during test sessions.</li>\n'
                                                   '            <li><strong>AI Voice & Gaze Detection:</strong> Flags '
                                                   'unauthorized background voices, screen-switching, or suspicious '
                                                   'eye movements for human proctor review.</li>\n'
                                                   '          </ul>\n'
                                                   '        </section>\n'
